{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"443d19965c635fe63afa0a012ef025427106bb48506da531fdd3a36981aee7bf","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"0523b49940c925506089a6f005215f40a9ffc1069275dcc1e83d11c6e9ff35a1","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"0c22616daeea5c4344db3cc9e6d855db76afe7dce0d4e4df28338b7e744b32a2","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"源文 treacherous road 在此指险恶难行的路，不是背叛。译文「背叛之路」译错了词义。源码 tome-ashes-urhrok/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua L688-708（来源未固定，sha256 b8a9216d…）：The Black Boots 的效果只有潜行、灵巧、移速与暗影之力加成，没有任何背叛或叛变主题。建议改为「险途」「险路」一类，例如「登临世界之巅的路途险恶难行」。"},{"revision_key":"0c451e854a29a4812b250517418d43985480babcf53b24593671ccb6d62ce2c0","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"0ed56881299d6e08842efe672f4bb7a42238c9b86d9c4f6b0f3b268ecc4a13df","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"100cec57ae5f773c8247a78bc74e6bdbfc1f0db0d466d630e9ac555a0187611d","verdict":"OK"}]}